.TH WIFI-HOTSPOT-TRAY 1 "2026-10-29" "RelayForge 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wifi-hotspot-tray \- RelayForge status tray indicator and menu
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wifi-hotspot-tray
[\fB\-\-show\-icon\fR] [\fB\-\-session\-start\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B wifi-hotspot-tray
runs the desktop status indicator for the RelayForge Wi\-Fi sharing service.
It shows the current sharing state, lets you toggle the hotspot, and surfaces
failure guidance. It is started automatically on login when autostart is enabled.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-show\-icon
Show the tray icon in this session.
.TP
.B \-\-session\-start
Refresh tray controls after package installation.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR wifi-hotspot-settings (1),
.BR relayforge-service (8)
